No wonder they feel helpless! But what will those dear parents do?
Will they obey Jehovah’s clear direction?
Or will they rationalize that they can have regular association with their disfellowshipped son and call it “necessary family business ”? In making their decision, they must not fail to consider how Jehovah feels about what they are doing.
