I never believed that what I did mattered to him.
HOLY SPIRIT CAN HELP SET YOU FREE How does God’s holy spirit help to set us free?
At 2 Corinthians 3: 17, we read: “Where the spirit of Jehovah is, there is freedom. ” How does holy spirit contribute to our freedom?
Among other things, it produces within us qualities that are essential to freedom — “love, joy, peace, long - suffering, kindness, goodness, faith, mildness, self - control. ”
Interestingly, after listing the spirit’s fruitage, the apostle Paul added: “Against such things there is no law. ” What did he mean?
It is Jehovah’s will that we cultivate Christlike qualities forever and display them without restriction. In what ways does the world’s spirit enslave those who submit to it?
The reality, however, is quite the opposite. Mountains of rules and regulations are necessary to curb their hurtful appetites and behavior.
They also are slaves of sin, driven to do “the things willed by the flesh, ” which is a cruel master.
