Jesus ’ coming is mentioned in what other scriptures? Regarding the faithful and discreet slave, Jesus says: “Happy is that slave if his master on arriving finds him doing so. ”
In the parable of the virgins, Jesus states: “While they were going off to buy, the bridegroom arrived . ”
To what time do these four instances of Jesus ’ coming refer? What have we stated about the arrival mentioned at Matthew 24: 46?
