Her boss had refused to give her a leave unless a replacement could be found. She had begged Jehovah to intervene — just as I had. ”
They learned that true satisfaction in life comes from serving Jehovah. The Benin branch oversees the work in all four lands, where French is spoken.
Pascal, a pioneer and Christian elder from France, has served in Benin for over 12 years. He states, “Seeing the brothers and sisters progress spiritually is a blessing. ”
In the ministry, I learned from the local brothers how to approach and greet people. What did some learn from me?
