What does it mean to love God?
Why should we love Jehovah?
How can we show our love for Jehovah God?
JEHOVAH’S Son, Jesus Christ, declared: “I love the Father. ”
After all, for ages during Jesus ’ prehuman existence, he was God’s “master worker. ”
