When we treat others as Jesus counseled, we act in harmony with the spirit behind “the Law ” (Genesis through Deuteronomy) and“ the Prophets ” (the prophetic books of the Hebrew Scriptures).
Happy is the man who does this. ”
We are indeed blessed because we act in a loving and righteous manner toward our neighbor.
