And how will our doing so benefit us?
Many do whatever it takes to get their way, often trampling on the feelings of those who are weaker.
Unlike Satan, who strips humans of their dignity, Jehovah views all of his servants, including those who seem to be weaker, as “necessary. ” That thought should help each of us to feel good about our role in the local congregation and about being part of the congregation of God’s people earth wide.
