Or do I place more emphasis on the physical blessings I hope to enjoy in Paradise? ’
Surely we can all benefit from examining our own actions and removing any vestiges of hypocrisy from our heart.
Why should we be genuine and sincere in our worship of Jehovah?
Yes, those who rid their heart of hypocrisy are happier, and they put themselves in line to enjoy perfect happiness in the future.
