COVER SUBJECT WILL YOU ACCEPT GOD’S GREATEST GIFT?
What makes a gift truly precious to you?
Likely four factors are involved: (1) who gave the gift to you, (2) why it was given, (3) what was sacrificed to make the gift possible, and (4) whether the gift filled a real need. Giving thought to those factors can help us to deepen our appreciation for the ransom — God’s greatest gift.
Not at all!
